WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The photo uses three thousand kilobytes. One thousand kilobytes is one megabyte. So the photo uses three megabytes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.267
There are twelve megabytes free. Take away the three used by the photo.

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:19.933
Tap nine megabytes. Both sizes were in the same unit when we subtracted.
